  "overview": "Persona Design System — Crisp light (#FBFCFD) canvas, system-ui typography, #0060df brand accent, and 8px corner geometry",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Dark (#408bdd) canvas paired with `#408bdd` component surfaces and `#15141a` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#0060df` with `#ffffff` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `system-ui` across 6 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
